      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 48 Glenealy Road, Crumlin, Dublin 12 to the market a super two/three bedroom extended mid terraced home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential location. Glenealy Road is renowned for its convenience and family-friendly surroundings, with an excellent range of local amenities on its doorstep including Sundrive Shopping Centre, SuperValu, cafés, restaurants and a variety of local shops. The area is also home to a selection of primary and secondary schools, together with an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities. Excellent public transport links, along with easy access to the M50, N7 and Dublin City Centre, make this an ideal location for first time buyers, growing families, and investors.\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 78 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, spacious lounge, extended kitchen and dining area, family bathroom and a versatile additional reception room which can be utilised as a third bedroom, home office or playroom. Upstairs hosts two generous double bedrooms, and an office space,  creating a flexible layout to suit a variety of lifestyles.\nA standout feature of No. 48 is the exceptionally large south west facing rear garden, offering an abundance of outdoor space together with excellent potential to further extend, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The property also benefits from a private driveway providing off street parking and gas fired central heating, making it a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a home with both immediate comfort and future potential.\nCombining generous accommodation, a highly versatile layout and an enviable location close to every conceivable amenity, No. 48 is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 78 sqm</li>\n <li>BER D2</li>\n <li>2/3 Bed / 1 bath</li>\n <li>Mid terraced extended home</li>\n <li>Off street parking</li>\n <li>Gas heating</li>\n <li>Double glazed windows</li>\n <li>Fully fitted kitchen</li>\n <li>Turn key condition</li>\n <li>Top quality finishes and fittings</li>\n <li>Extra-large south west facing garden</li>\n <li>Bright and airy</li>\n <li>Well-proportioned layout throughout</li>\n <li>Plenty of transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Wide range of local amenities within walking distance</li>\n <li>Highly sought after location</li>\n <li>Ideal for a wide range of buyers</li>\n <li>Viewing highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D12FN23"
      },
      {
